# food_raid (kenshi-h2v.21.3; docs/reference/SCENARIO_IMPORT.md `town` / `container` / `raid`). The Old Village (a gateless 875 u town; Heft's gates make the raiders
# assault them first, goal 270, and never loot) is the player's, with a wooden chest of 30 Bread; four Sand ninjas, a campaign force on the march against it (the
# 'Sand ninja standard raid' record, as live run 1 of rwh.52), start 400 u out. Two player characters stand by the chest: the ninjas knock them out, then loot.
